<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Application Form</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  }
  .header-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .header-logo img {
    height: 50px; /* Placeholder for logo size */
    margin-right: 15px;
  }
  .header-text h1 {
    font-size: 24pt;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .header-text h2 {
    font-size: 12pt;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: normal;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 14pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .form-row {
    display: flex;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .form-row > div {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .label-col {
    width: 150px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .input-col {
    flex-grow: 1;
  }
  .line-break {
    border-bottom: 1px solid black;
    display: inline-block;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 5px;
  }
  .checkbox-group {
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .checkbox-group label {
    font-weight: normal;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-right: 20px;
  }
  .footer-note {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 50px;
    font-size: 10pt;
  }
  .signature-line {
    margin-top: 50px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <!-- Placeholder for logo -->
    <div style="width: 50px; height: 50px; border: 1px solid #ccc;"></div>
    <div class="header-text">
      <h1>Texas Health Resources Foundation</h1>
      <h2>Healing Hands. Caring Hearts.</h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 30px;">2021-2022 W.W. Ward Endowment Fund</h3>
  <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">Harris College of Nursing & Health Sciences</h3>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="label-col">Deadline:</div>
    <div class="input-col">
      <span data-field="deadline">{{ deadline }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label-col">Student Name:</div>
    <div class="input-col">
      <span data-field="full_name" class="line-break">{{ full_name }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label-col">Address:</div>
    <div class="input-col">
      <span data-field="address" class="line-break">{{ address }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label-col">City:</div>
    <div class="input-col">
      <span data-field="city" class="line-break">{{ city }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label-col">State:</div>
    <div class="input-col">
      <span data-field="state" class="line-break">{{ state }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label-col">Telephone:</div>
    <div class="input-col">
      <span data-field="phone_number" class="line-break">{{ phone_number }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label-col">Zip:</div>
    <div class="input-col">
      <span data-field="zip_code" class="line-break">{{ zip_code }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="label-col" style="width: auto;">I am applying for financial aid for the academic semester below:</div>
    <div class="input-col">
      <input type="checkbox" id="semester_check">
      <label for="semester_check">Spring 2022</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <div class="label-col">Classification (in the above semester):</div>
    <div class="input-col">
      <span data-field="classification">{{ classification }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 40px;">I certify:</div>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li>I am a student in good standing with TCU Nursing.</li>
    <li>I am not employed, nor am I committed to employment following graduation, at a Non-Texas Health Resources health care facility.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">Submission Criteria:</div>
  <div class="checkbox-group">
    <input type="checkbox" id="complete_app">
    <label for="complete_app">Complete Application</label><br>
    <input type="checkbox" id="attached_essay">
    <label for="attached_essay">Attached essay</label><br>
    <input type="checkbox" id="fafsa_on_file">
    <label for="fafsa_on_file">FAFSA on file in Financial Aid</label>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 10pt;">All of the above criteria must be completed and on file in order to complete the application process.</p>

  <div class="signature-line">
    <div>Student Signature</div>
    <div>Date</div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-note">
    Page 1 of 2
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <!-- Placeholder for logo -->
    <div style="width: 50px; height: 50px; border: 1px solid #ccc;"></div>
    <div class="header-text">
      <h1>Texas Health Resources Foundation</h1>
      <h2>Healing Hands. Caring Hearts.</h2>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 30px;">2021-2022 W.W. Ward Endowment Fund</h3>
  <h3 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">Harris College of Nursing & Health Sciences</h3>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">A History of Devotion</div>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">
    The Harris College of Nursing & Health Sciences has been blessed with a number of strong contributors who have helped to establish and expand it over the years. One man demonstrated a unique sense of devotion to the school and the financial needs of its students. The Reverend Dr. W. W. Ward, a 25-year member of the Harris College of Nursing & Health Sciences, made a lasting contribution through his efforts as scholarship chairman of the board.
  </p>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">Dr. Ward's dedication to providing funds for nursing students began before the school was established, and continued through the years. He worked to promote the creation of a scholarship endowment fund through the Harris Methodist Health System, where he had served as chaplain/commissioner. He solicited funds from as many sources as possible, including churches and individuals, to meet the urgent needs of the students.</div>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">A labor of love for Dr. Ward, his seemingly endless dedication continues to benefit students of the Harris College of Nursing & Health Sciences. The W. W. Ward Endowment Fund of Harris Methodist Health System bears his name in recognition of his efforts in fundraising for nursing students at Harris College. And so, through the devotion and concern of an extraordinary man, present and future students of the Harris College of Nursing & Health Sciences may receive help in funding their education.</div>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">W.W. Ward Endowment Fund Policies and Information</div>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">
    Eligibility is limited to full-time nursing students enrolled in nursing at Texas Christian University. A FAFSA (Free Application for Federal Student Aid) must be on file in the Texas Christian University Financial Aid office to be eligible for consideration.
  </p>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">Employment Status</div>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">
    If employed, the candidate may not be employed by a non-Texas Health Resources affiliated health care organization.
  </p>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">Maximum Scholarship Amount</div>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">
    Students may receive up to <span data-field="max_scholarship_amount">{{ max_scholarship_amount }}</span> during the spring semester. There is no lifetime maximum of funds one student may receive, as long as the student is eligible and reapplies each semester.
  </p>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">Grades</div>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">
    The student must maintain a grade point average of 2.5 or above to apply for scholarship funds for the next semester.
  </p>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">Application Process</div>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">
    Submit a completed application, by the appropriate due date, to TCU Nursing along with a typed essay which addresses the student's financial need, professional goals, current employment, if any, and any special situations which might influence the decision to award the scholarship.
  </p>

  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 30px;">Evaluation Criteria</div>
  <ol style="padding-left: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
    <li>Financial need</li>
    <li>Academic achievement</li>
    <li>Employment preference (Texas Health Harris Methodist hospitals)</li>
    <li>Classification (Jr. or Sr. level status)</li>
  </ol>

  <div class="footer-note">
    Page 2 of 2
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="footer-note" style="margin-top: 0;">
    Please submit all documentation to:
    <br>
    TCU Nursing
    <br>
    Texas Christian University
    <br>
    TCU Box 298620
    <br>
    Fort Worth, Texas {{ zip_code }}
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>